## 4. Middle snippet

```go
// GET /v1/workspaces/{id}/coder-app/{slug}?plane=a[&format=json]
// Mints a plane user token and builds the real Coder app URL (path or subdomain).
// No middle app proxy.

// … mint tok, load workspace, build `target` (may set ?coder_session_token=) …

if wantsJSON(r) {
	writeJSON(w, http.StatusOK, map[string]any{
		"url":       target,
		"subdomain": subdomain,
		"slug":      slug,
		"plane_id":  p.ID,
	})
	return
}
http.Redirect(w, r, target, http.StatusFound)

func wantsJSON(r *http.Request) bool {
	if r.URL.Query().Get("format") == "json" {
		return true
	}
	return strings.Contains(r.Header.Get("Accept"), "application/json")
}
```

Example JSON body:

```json
{
  "url": "http://airflow--lime-dolphin-21--alice.coder.127.0.0.1.sslip.io:3000/?coder_session_token=…",
  "subdomain": true,
  "slug": "airflow",
  "plane_id": "a"
}
```

