## 5. Hand-off summary for FE

| Do | Don’t |
| --- | --- |
| `GET …/coder-app/{slug}?format=json` with Bearer | Navigate the browser to middle and expect the portal strip trick after a 302 |
| Open Coder’s `url`, then strip `coder_session_token` yourself | Leave the token in the address bar |
| Skip strip when the param is absent | Use `noopener` on the token open (you lose the window handle) |

Longer-term (optional): serve middle on the plane hostname and set an HttpOnly cookie (`Domain=` for subdomain apps, host-only for path apps) so `url` can be clean without a query token. Until then, JSON + open + strip is the lab/production-friendly approach for the portal.
